        "title": "Modern lines in white cedar",
        "lede": "The CT Luna’s rounded corners do more than look good: they make the room feel open and spacious.",
        "items": [
          [
            "Rounded corners",
            "A modern profile in solid Eastern White Cedar log walls, built for durability and strength."
          ],
          [
            "Leak-proof roof",
            "An EPDM rubber shield with a slight slope keeps water moving off the roof."
          ],
          [
            "Two-tier benches",
            "A two-tier layout that suits everyone, whether you like it hot up high or milder below."
          ],
          [
            "Electric heat",
            "Sized for a 7.5 kW electric heater on a 240V circuit."
          ]
        ]
      },
